// SRD 5.1 spell (docs/dnd.srd.5.1/07_Spells). Points default to the level; cantrips are free.
// Non-consumed SRD components are dropped (PRD §8.3); consumed ones go in `components`.
// `effect` is the shape of what the spell does; the numbers are rule slots in data/rules/casting.ron.
// Durations are party-clock minutes: a fight round is one minute, so the SRD's "1 minute" is 10.
// Deviation: one melee spell attack when cast, 1d8 force; the weapon does not stay for the
// minute, its bonus-action attacks wait for the turn budget (M7c), and the casting modifier on
// the damage is dropped (attack spells add dice only).
(schema: 1, id: "base:spell:spiritual_weapon", name: "base:text:spell.spiritual_weapon.name", level: 2, school: Evocation, classes: ["base:class:cleric"], concentration: false, ritual: false, description: "base:text:spell.spiritual_weapon.description", effect: Some(Attack(dice: (count: 1, sides: 8, modifier: 0), damage_type: Force)), reach: One)
